+<section id="flow">
+  <div class="sec-head">
+    <div class="eyebrow"><svg class="ico"><use href="assets/icons.svg#i-flow"/></svg>Main flow</div>
+    <h2>From request to close: six commands, two gates</h2>
+    <p><code>/delixcrew:start</code> proposes two things. <strong>Size</strong> shows how much process the work needs: S, M or L. <strong>Tier</strong> shows the risk: 1, 2 or 3. The higher the tier, the more review and approval it takes. For a small, well-described job, a single session plus <code>/delixcrew:verify</code> is proposed instead of the full flow.</p>
