+      <figcaption><strong>write_gate decision order.</strong> <code>scripts/write_gate.py</code> asks these questions in this order and stops at the first "yes". It checks calls to the Write, Edit, MultiEdit and NotebookEdit tools. A new test file is free; an existing test file can be written only if it is in the card's Files list.</figcaption>
