+<section id="self-feeding">
+  <div class="sec-head">
+    <div class="eyebrow"><svg class="ico"><use href="assets/icons.svg#i-loop"/></svg>Self-feeding · 0.5.0 and 0.6.0</div>
+    <h2>The plugin reports its own faults; a human still sends them</h2>
+    <p>When delixcrew sees a fault of its own in a project, it writes it to a local draft. The draft is redacted, the user sees the full text and sends it from their own terminal. The finding becomes a GitHub issue, goes through triage and, if accepted, re-enters the workflow through <code>/delixcrew:start #&lt;n&gt;</code>.</p>
